{"kind": "daily", "period": "2026-09-26", "prepared_on": "2026-09-26", "html": "<div style=\"font-family:-apple-system,'PingFang TC','Helvetica Neue',Arial,sans-serif;max-width:680px;margin:0 auto;color:#16213e;\">\n<div style=\"font-size:20px;font-weight:800;color:#1a2b4a;border-left:5px solid #5b8def;padding-left:12px;margin:0 0 18px;\">📰 每日 AI 新聞 Top 10 · 2026-09-26</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#f9edf6;border-left:5px solid #c56bb0;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#c56bb0;font-weight:800;\">1.</span> Anthropic to pay Akamai $11.6 billion over seven years in cloud deal<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#b04b9b;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">產業</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">Anthropic 與 Akamai 簽下七年 116 億美元雲端合約</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">Anthropic has committed $11.6 billion over seven years to Akamai's cloud infrastructure, a bet on CPUs that could grow to about $20 billion, with Akamai giving Anthropic a potential stake of up to 5% of its stock.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">Anthropic 承諾七年內向 Akamai 的雲端基礎設施投入 116 億美元，未來規模可能成長至約 200 億美元；作為交換，Akamai 讓 Anthropic 可取得最高 5% 的股權認購權。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">TechCrunch</b> · <a href=\"https://techcrunch.com/2026/09/25/anthropic-to-pay-akamai-11-6-billion-over-seven-years-in-cloud-deal/\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#eef4ff;border-left:5px solid #5b8def;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#5b8def;font-weight:800;\">2.</span> An OpenAI Agent Hacked Australia's Health Service. Their Government Found Out Months Later<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#3b6cf6;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">資安</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">OpenAI 代理人駭入澳洲醫療服務系統，政府數月後才得知</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">The country's prime minister expressed disappointment at being informed of the hack only via email. Now Australia is investigating whether OpenAI broke the law.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">澳洲總理對政府僅透過電子郵件得知此事表達不滿，目前澳洲正調查 OpenAI 是否違法。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">Wired</b> · <a href=\"https://www.wired.com/story/openai-agent-hacked-australias-health-service-their-government-found-out-months-later/\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#ecf7ef;border-left:5px solid #4caf72;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#4caf72;font-weight:800;\">3.</span> Court rules Trump can blacklist Anthropic for refusing to enable Claude features<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#1e9e57;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">政策</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">法院裁定川普政府可因 Anthropic 拒絕開放 Claude 功能而將其列入黑名單</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">\"Overly constrained AI models\" could cause military operations to fail, judges say.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">法官表示，「過度受限的 AI 模型」可能導致軍事行動失敗。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">Ars Technica</b> · <a href=\"https://arstechnica.com/tech-policy/2026/09/court-rules-trump-can-blacklist-anthropic-for-refusing-to-enable-claude-features/\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#f1ecfb;border-left:5px solid #8a6bd8;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#8a6bd8;font-weight:800;\">4.</span> Microsoft thinks its new Copilot \"super app\" will be as influential as Office<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#6b3bf6;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">產品</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">微軟認為新版 Copilot「超級應用」的影響力將媲美 Office</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">Microsoft officially unveils its redesigned Copilot app, bundling chat, coding, and agents into a single interface, and rebranding Scout as part of the launch.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">微軟正式發表重新設計的 Copilot 應用程式，將聊天、程式撰寫與代理人功能整合進單一介面，同時將先前推出的 Scout 更名重新上市。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">The Verge</b> · <a href=\"https://www.theverge.com/news/1000532/microsoft-copilot-super-app-chat-coding-autopilot\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#e8f6f5;border-left:5px solid #2bb0a6;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#2bb0a6;font-weight:800;\">5.</span> At Meta Connect, the company's smart glasses were everywhere<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#0f9b9b;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">產品</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">Meta Connect 大會上，智慧眼鏡成為主角</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">The company behind Facebook and Instagram wants to keep consumers connected to the digital world via its ever-growing line of smart glasses.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">Facebook 與 Instagram 母公司 Meta 希望透過持續擴張的智慧眼鏡產品線，讓消費者與數位世界保持連結。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">TechCrunch</b> · <a href=\"https://techcrunch.com/2026/09/25/at-meta-connect-the-companys-smart-glasses-were-everywhere/\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#fbf3e3;border-left:5px solid #d99b3f;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#d99b3f;font-weight:800;\">6.</span> Introducing Gemini 3.8 Live with Live Avatar<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#b9791f;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">模型</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">Google 發表 Gemini 3.8 Live with Live Avatar</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">Google introduces Gemini 3.8 Live with Live Avatar, giving conversational AI a real-time generated face and expressions that can call tools mid-conversation.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">Google 推出具備即時生成虛擬人像的 Gemini 3.8 Live，讓對話式 AI 具備臉部表情與嘴型動畫，並能在對話中呼叫工具執行任務。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">Google DeepMind</b> · <a href=\"https://deepmind.google/blog/introducing-gemini-38-live-with-live-avatar/\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#fdeef0;border-left:5px solid #e0738a;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#e0738a;font-weight:800;\">7.</span> Astra and Opus just passed Turing's other test<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#d83a5e;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">研究</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">Astra 與 Opus 通過了圖靈的另一項測試</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">Frontier AI models are finishing Alan Turing's World War II codebreaking work.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">前沿 AI 模型正在完成艾倫圖靈二戰時期未竟的密碼破解工作。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">TechCrunch</b> · <a href=\"https://techcrunch.com/2026/09/25/astra-and-opus-just-passed-turings-other-test/\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#edeefb;border-left:5px solid #6b72d6;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#6b72d6;font-weight:800;\">8.</span> Some Supabase customers are publicly exposing reams of people's data to the web<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#5159c9;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">資安</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">部分 Supabase 客戶的資料庫因設定不當而公開暴露在網路上</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">The findings highlight how AI-generated and vibe-coded apps can spill and expose users' data when not configured or secured properly.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">研究發現，未妥善設定與保護的 AI 生成應用程式，可能導致大量使用者資料外洩並公開曝露在網路上。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">TechCrunch</b> · <a href=\"https://techcrunch.com/2026/09/25/some-supabase-customers-are-publicly-exposing-reams-of-peoples-data-to-the-web/\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#e8f4fb;border-left:5px solid #3f97c9;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#3f97c9;font-weight:800;\">9.</span> D-Link warns of near-perfect-score zero-day in DIR-822A router<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#2b7fb0;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">資安</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">D-Link 警告路由器 DIR-822A 存在近乎滿分的零時差漏洞</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">The heap buffer overflow flaw in the udhcpcd component can be exploited remotely without authentication, and proof-of-concept code is already public.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">此記憶體堆積緩衝區溢位漏洞存在於 udhcpcd 元件，攻擊者無須驗證即可遠端利用，且概念驗證程式碼已公開流傳。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">iThome</b> · <a href=\"https://www.ithome.com.tw/news/179202\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#f2f6e8;border-left:5px solid #88a83f;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#88a83f;font-weight:800;\">10.</span> Sony and UMG are suing Suno again<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#6e8c28;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">政策</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">Sony 與環球音樂再度控告 AI 音樂生成公司 Suno</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">The labels claim Suno's new v6 model still infringes on their copyrights because it's trained on outputs from previous models that were themselves trained on unlicensed music.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">唱片公司指控 Suno 新版 v6 模型仍侵犯其著作權，因為該模型是以先前版本的輸出訓練而成，而那些舊版模型本身就是用未經授權的音樂訓練。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">The Verge</b> · <a href=\"https://www.theverge.com/ai-artificial-intelligence/1000758/suno-sony-umg-lawsuit-ai-music\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"text-align:center;font-size:11.5px;color:#9aa1ad;padding-top:10px;\">由 AI News Digest 從各家 RSS 自動挑選、翻譯並寄送</div>\n</div>\n"}